{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14767","headline":"送崔邠拾遗 · 卢纶","name":"送崔邠拾遗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"皎洁无瑕清玉壶，晓乘华幰向天衢。\n石建每闻宗谨孝，刘歆不敢衒师儒。\n谏修郊庙开宸虑，议按休徵浅瑞图。\n今日攀车复何者，辕门垂白一愚夫。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢纶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14767.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14767","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}